<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS V SRI LANKA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS V SRI LANKA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>opening day of the three-day tour match between the Leeward</p>
<p>Islands and Sri Lanka on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings</p>
<p> R.Mahanama c Jacobs b Quinn		65</p>
<p> R.Arnold c Adams b Quinn		   14</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Mitchum b Mills	     11</p>
<p> A.de Silva c Morton b Mills		 6</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga b Bass			   35</p>
<p> H.Tillekeratne not out		     23</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana lbw b Irish		28</p>
<p> K.Dharmasena not out			  8</p>
<p> Extras (lb-2)				   2</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets, declared)     192</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-25 2-38 3-48 4-132 5-146 6-180</p>
<p>Did not bat: Dilip Liyanage, Muttiah Muralitharan, Ravindra</p>
<p>Pushpakumara</p>
<p>Bowling: Quinn 19-8-21-2, Irish 17-4-48-1, Mills</p>
<p>16-5-31-2, Phillip 8-1-31-0, Bass 18-3-59-1</p>
