<p>Phillip, Lesroy Irish, Whitmore Quinn, Mickey Mills</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Pushpakumara 3-0-4-0 (nb-2), Liyanage</p>
<p>5-0-23-2, Murulitharan 2-1-2-0</p>
